@startuml
allowmixing
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title API client milestone (selected implemented types)
component "Smurfs.Domain" as Domain {
  enum Gender
}
component "Smurfs.Application" as Application {
  interface ISmurfReadService
  class "List.Handler" as Handler
  class "List.Query" as Query
  class SmurfDto
  class "PagedList<T>" as Page
}
component "Smurfs.Persistence.API" as Adapter {
  class SmurfsApiClient {
    +CreateSmurfAsync(name, cancellationToken) : Task
  }
  class ApiUser
  class ApiException
}
component "Smurfs.UI.Console.API" as Console {
  class Program
}
SmurfsApiClient .up.|> ISmurfReadService
SmurfsApiClient .up.> Gender : JSON converter
SmurfsApiClient .up.> SmurfDto : decodes
SmurfsApiClient .up.> Page : constructs
SmurfsApiClient --> ApiUser : returns from login
SmurfsApiClient ..> ApiException : reports HTTP status
Handler --> ISmurfReadService : requests page
Handler ..> Query : handles
ISmurfReadService ..> SmurfDto : item type
ISmurfReadService ..> Page : returns
SmurfDto .up.> Gender : optional value
Program .up.> SmurfsApiClient : constructs / signs in / creates
Program .up.> ApiUser : displays account
Program .up.> ApiException : handles authentication failure
Program .up.> Handler : constructs / invokes
Program .up.> Query : constructs
legend bottom
  Components represent production assemblies.
  Selected direct type dependencies; BCL and internal wire models omitted.
  Unimplemented write skeletons are outside this milestone.
  Server interaction is HTTP, not an assembly reference.
endlegend
@enduml
